neutral autonomy platform. The mandatory control set (verifier register, global
verifier, pre-task authority snapshot, document authority) must work without any
web file while every missing mandatory PLATFORM dependency still stops. This gate
exercises the real `controller/verify/cli`, `controller/loop/cli` and the real
imported autopilot callables of --subject in disposable Git replicas, and
exercises the PROPOSED human-hand files (SEPARATION-20260910/proposed/) inside
fixtures. No historical gate, provider, build, publication or resume is executed.
